This file contains a few notes on LSH operation and installation. The 
informatioеееееееееds command 
lines to a text file which may be edited and recycled as desired.
Editing commands are similar to WordStar's.  Useеееееееееe running ZCPR3.3 need to patch the first byte of the Type 3 
version to C3h (JP), rather than C7h (RST 0).  No Type 1 version еееееееееed Log LSH, and 
contains some minor tuneups.  The companion error handler is also fixed.

