USER ROUTINE

   еееееееееg the disk 
for wildcard matches. For example, "FO" is converted to "FO*.*", then 
the first thing that matches replaces "FO" еееееееее The patch 
must end with RET if LSH is to keep running.  All registers are 
available for your use.  

     Code can be assеееееееее, only .COM types are matched (along the path), and a trailing 
space is appended.  Then you are immediately ready to add commaеееееееееn also enter hex code directly with LSHINST.

     The patch could be used to send a terminal or printer init 
